---
layout: layouts/base.njk
title: "Patient Testimonials"
description: "Patient reviews for 3rd Set Smiles in Tempe, AZ — real 5-star Yelp reviews for Dr. Matthew Phillips, plus links to read more on Google, Yelp, and Facebook."
permalink: /testimonials/
breadcrumb:
  - { label: "Home", url: "/" }
  - { label: "Testimonials", url: "/testimonials/" }
---

<section class="page-hero">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span class="sep">›</span>Testimonials</div>
    <h1>Patient <span>Testimonials</span></h1>
    <p class="lede">Honest words from the people we're proud to call patients — rated <a href="{{ site.social.yelp }}" rel="noopener" style="color:var(--gold-light)">5.0 on Yelp</a>.</p>
  </div>
</section>

{# Reviews come from src/_data/reviews.js (verified Yelp reviews). Displayed as
   attributed social proof only — deliberately NO Review/aggregateRating JSON-LD:
   Google doesn't surface rich results for self-serving LocalBusiness review
   markup, and these are third-party (Yelp) reviews. Star rich results come from
   the practice's Google Business Profile, not site markup. #}
<section class="section">
  <div class="container">
    <div class="testimonial-grid">
      {% for r in reviews %}
      <figure class="testimonial-card fade-in">
        <div class="review-stars" aria-label="{{ r.rating }} out of 5 stars" role="img">
          {% for i in range(0, r.rating) %}★{% endfor %}
        </div>
        <blockquote>{{ r.quote }}</blockquote>
        <figcaption>
          <cite>{{ r.author }}</cite>
          <span class="review-meta">{% if r.location %}{{ r.location }} &middot; {% endif %}{{ r.date | monthYear }} &middot; via {{ r.source }}</span>
        </figcaption>
      </figure>
      {% endfor %}
    </div>

    <div class="notice fade-in" style="max-width:760px;margin:36px auto 0;text-align:center">
      <strong>Read more reviews.</strong>
      <p style="margin-top:10px">See what real patients are saying about Dr. Phillips and the team on:</p>
      <p style="margin-top:14px">
        <a class="btn-outline btn-outline-dark" href="{{ site.social.google }}" rel="noopener">Google reviews</a>
        &nbsp;
        <a class="btn-outline btn-outline-dark" href="{{ site.social.yelp }}" rel="noopener">Yelp reviews</a>
        &nbsp;
        <a class="btn-outline btn-outline-dark" href="{{ site.social.facebook }}" rel="noopener">Facebook</a>
      </p>
    </div>

    {# QR is generated from site.review.googleUrl; regenerate the static asset
       whenever that centrally configured destination changes. #}
    {% set reviewHeading = "Leave Us a Google Review" %}
    {% set reviewIntro = "If you've visited 3rd Set Smiles, your honest feedback helps the next Tempe family make an informed choice. You can also leave a review on Yelp." %}
    {% set showReviewQr = true %}
    {% set reviewSource = "testimonials" %}
    {% include "partials/review-cta.njk" %}
  </div>
</section>
